# Model predictions only

Never use bookmaker odds alone as the prediction.

Official outputs must come from WDE + ECSE model runs.

Do not invent exact scores, manual Poisson, or odds-only picks.

Mark unsupported friendlies as UNSUPPORTED — do not predict them as Tier A/B.
